                &lt;h2&gt;Module 2: Safe Measures, Threat Recognition, and Guard Duties&lt;/h2&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;Effective site protection starts with preventive safety measures and threat awareness.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;h3&gt;Importance of Safe Measures&lt;/h3&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Protection of lives and property.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Enhancing public confidence in private security operations.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Reducing risks affecting the location or event.&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;

                &lt;h3&gt;Potential Threat Categories&lt;/h3&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crowd threats:&lt;/strong&gt; scramble, panic, crowd surge, chaos.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical threats:&lt;/strong&gt; camera failure, communication failure, access-control faults.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural and emergency incidents:&lt;/strong&gt; fire, medical emergency, structural hazards.&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;

                &lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities of Security Personnel&lt;/h3&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Strict commitment to field procedures and chain of command.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Provide initial support in emergency cases until specialists arrive.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Coordinate with police and civil defense without delay.&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Provide accurate real-time updates to control room and supervisors.&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            </field>
        </record>

